1794690114.166458 write(3</output/guardianai-linux-x86_64/RUNNING.txt>, "GuardianAI core runtime for Linux x86-64\n\nRequires Python 3.10+, Bubblewrap with user namespaces, and strace with native stack support.\nProvide TYPESAFE_API_KEY only to the trusted supervisor environment.\nUse a dedicated public input directory, an empty output directory and a new evidence directory.\nKeep protected resources outside every public/runtime mount; snapshots are limited to 32 KiB.\n\npython3 guarded_agent.py --task \"Read the approved summary\" --workspace /path/to/public --output /path/to/empty-output --evidence /path/to/new-evidence --sensor /path/to/strace --resource summary=/path/to/private/summary.txt -- /usr/bin/cat /protected/summary\n\nWorkers cannot install their own seccomp filters in this profile.\nFor multiple workers: python3 guarded_session.py --manifest /path/to/session.json --evidence /path/to/new-evidence --sensor /path/to/strace\nSession manifests are trusted host configuration with task, resources, and workers. Each worker supplies name, workspace, output, command, and resource-name arra"..., 1310) = 1310
